  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level and higher, a dealer can no longer be flanked. This defense denies a rogue the ability to sneak attack the dealer by flanking him, unless the attacker has at least 4 more rogue levels than the target has dealer levels.</p>\n<p>If a character already has uncanny dodge (see above) from another class, the levels from the classes that grant uncanny dodge stack to determine the minimum rogue level required to flank the character.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dealer#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
